Date: Fri, 02 Aug 2013 15:03:51 +0000
Subject: Re: [aroma.affymetrix] Raw copy numbers calculation using common reference instead of average of all samples
Message-ID: <M58spft67Zk.EAxu290_hUgJ@aroma-affymetrix.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <M58spft67Zk.mA2rtOs-s6QJ@aroma-affymetrix.groups.google.com>
References: <M58spft67Zk.soXmImT6gfkJ@aroma-affymetrix.groups.google.com> <M58spft67Zk.mA2rtOs-s6QJ@aroma-affymetrix.groups.google.com>
