>> >> Skip the exportTotalCnRatioSet() call, and instead use:
>> >>
>> >> sm <- CbsModel(dsTR, ref=dfR, tags="HapMapRef");
>> >>
>> >> The 'tags' is just to add an informative tag to the output data set.
>> >>
>> >> /Henrik
