>> >> >> Or are you asking how to extract the data from all samples?  Then
>> >> >> you
>> >> >> can
>> >> >> do:
>> >> >>
>> >> >> theta <- extractTheta(cesN, units=units)
>> >> >>
>> >> >> but be careful because that loads a lot of data into memory.
>> >> >>
>> >> >> Hope this helps,
>> >> >>
