> >> >> >> do
> >> >> >> need to iterate over them somehow.  Is this what you're looking for?
> >> >> >>
> >> >> >> for (ii in seq_along(cesN)) {
> >> >> >>   ce <- getFile(cesN, ii)
> >> >> >>   ...
> >> >> >> }
> >> >> >>
